{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/advisory-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After using black magic to save our daughter, things took a biblical turn. My daughter is gone, and my wife has become a demonic monster. Angels, demons, and pagans\u2014who do I trust? Venturing into the unknown, I can't help but wonder: why does she still get mad (well, more, because she always seems angry now) when I fart? Wait, does she remember who I am? Awww!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/line_1.png?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/imp-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I'm not sure what they are trying to do here. Why are they showing up with things I need but take them away again? I'd better not show my back against them. I don't think I can trust them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/line_1.png?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/box-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I saw my wife do this before and with her gone, I think I should carry on whatever this is. I'm not even sure who these boxes are for or who leave them outside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/line_1.png?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/help-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So, demons are helping me? I thought they were the bad ones. Well, he has a great smile, so maybe I shouldn't question for now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/line_1.png?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/hound-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These druidic magics are working like a charm. I can't believe an angel is helping me. But, he seems to mumble weird things. I don't think I should get too close to him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/line_1.png?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/kneel-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I think the rabbit guided me to somewhere I shouldn't be. Well, I mean I shouldn't be here, like, right here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/line_1.png?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/water-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why is a skeleton serving an angel under the bloody water filled with bones? Is he an angel? Or demon? What is he?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/line_1.png?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/fight-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Well, it looks like some angels and demons are still not getting along, seeing as how my demonic wife is chasing after a fairy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/line_1.png?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the world of She is mad. Here you'll meet angels and demons in their natural habitats. Sometimes pagans or gods too, but they don't really have names for themselves sometimes. They say it's been just so long and they forgot who they are or where they came from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feature:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Normal, nightmare, hell modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wife skins unlocked as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can fart (It is either necessary or life-threatening)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leave Love Messages for others or upvote</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ever growing chapters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have what it takes to save the family?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Father of the year","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1973170/770b6ecbd989950e693b1185b541cef214a03d84.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1973170?t=1744452778","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/ed9f08b4b6a1cb12375ace8e9bf743567b10eba6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744452778","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/6c0530427c0da8ae2176262bca418eafc36217af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744452778","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/6c0530427c0da8ae2176262bca418eafc36217af/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744452778","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Gore, violence, blasphemy"},"demos":[{"appid":3594480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/advisory-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After using black magic to save our daughter, things took a biblical turn. My daughter is gone, and my wife has become a demonic monster. Angels, demons, and pagans\u2014who do I trust? Venturing into the unknown, I can't help but wonder: why does she still get mad (well, more, because she always seems angry now) when I fart? Wait, does she remember who I am? Awww!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/line_1.png?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/imp-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I'm not sure what they are trying to do here. Why are they showing up with things I need but take them away again? I'd better not show my back against them. I don't think I can trust them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/line_1.png?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/box-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I saw my wife do this before and with her gone, I think I should carry on whatever this is. I'm not even sure who these boxes are for or who leave them outside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/line_1.png?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/help-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So, demons are helping me? I thought they were the bad ones. Well, he has a great smile, so maybe I shouldn't question for now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/line_1.png?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/hound-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These druidic magics are working like a charm. I can't believe an angel is helping me. But, he seems to mumble weird things. I don't think I should get too close to him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/line_1.png?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/kneel-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I think the rabbit guided me to somewhere I shouldn't be. Well, I mean I shouldn't be here, like, right here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/line_1.png?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/water-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why is a skeleton serving an angel under the bloody water filled with bones? Is he an angel? Or demon? What is he?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/line_1.png?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/fight-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Well, it looks like some angels and demons are still not getting along, seeing as how my demonic wife is chasing after a fairy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/extras/line_1.png?t=1744452778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the world of She is mad. Here you'll meet angels and demons in their natural habitats. Sometimes pagans or gods too, but they don't really have names for themselves sometimes. They say it's been just so long and they forgot who they are or where they came from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feature:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Normal, nightmare, hell modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wife skins unlocked as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can fart (It is either necessary or life-threatening)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leave Love Messages for others or upvote</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ever growing chapters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have what it takes to save the family?</p>","developers":["Proteinbeer"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973170/c72db01da1c3c6eb91d90d18b144660d29305c23/header.jpg?t=1744452778","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"She is mad","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"She is mad - $2.99 USD","packageid":712571,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":299}],"title":"Buy She is mad"}],"packages":[712571],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 200 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":tr